Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.43,0:01:13.18,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,O qu-, mas já?!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.18,0:01:17.22,Black,Sirius Symboli,0,0,0,,Tentando medir minhas habilidades com algo deste calibre...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.86,0:01:19.68,Black,,0,0,0,,Que piada.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.28,0:01:26.36,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,E-eu também terminei!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.41,0:01:36.74,Black,Sirius Symboli,0,0,0,,Que tal fazer um all-in?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.74,0:01:39.50,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,All-in no jogo do mico...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.50,0:01:40.83,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,Vou aceitar!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.83,0:01:44.08,Black,Sirius Symboli,0,0,0,,{\t(2606,3274,1,\c&H000000&)}Heh... esta garota...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.34,0:01:51.72,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,Sirius-san...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.05,0:01:54.96,Black,Sirius Symboli,0,0,0,,Como você vai me acompanhar ficando exausta desse jeito?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.96,0:01:56.05,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,Desculpa...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.52,0:02:00.93,Black,Sirius Symboli,0,0,0,,Mas... eu não odeio Uma Musumes que não sabem quando desistir.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.25,0:02:03.95,Black,Sirius Symboli,0,0,0,,Tudo bem então, eu aceito você...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.58,0:02:07.78,Black,Sirius Symboli,0,0,0,,Como meu brinquedo novo.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.57,0:02:12.11,Black,Sirius Symboli,0,0,0,,Não me decepcione.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.82,0:02:17.91,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,Entendido! Então conto com você!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.21,0:02:21.12,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,Mas eu preciso ir treinar com o meu time, então estou indo agora!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.12,0:02:21.16,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,{\pos(955.2,1020)}Mas eu preciso ir treinar com o meu time, então estou indo agora!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.16,0:02:21.20,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,{\pos(942.4,1020)}Mas eu preciso ir treinar com o meu time, então estou indo agora!
